~ start
Vessa: The forge is cold. Nobody has lit it since the Master left.
Malrik: Little Vessa. You came after all.
- I am not little anymore.
	Vessa: I lead the Emberguard now. Say what you came to say.
	set trust -= 1
	=> ashes
- Where is the Master, Malrik?
	Malrik: Gone. Everyone tells my story, but nobody asks me that.
	set trust += 1
	=> ashes
- Light the forge. [if embers >= 3 /]
	do light_forge()
	Vessa: There. Now we can see each other.
	=> ashes

~ ashes
if trust > 0
	Malrik: Then listen. I kept something of his.
else
	Malrik: Then we have nothing to say. Not yet.
Vessa: We will see, shadow.
=> END
